# Extend roots

Extend `RutDigital.Common.Gateway.GraphQL` roots. Do not declare a new root `Query` / `Mutation` / `Subscription`.

```csharp
using RutDigital.Common.Gateway.GraphQL;

[ExtendObjectType(typeof(Query))]
public class ItemQuery
{
}
```
